@simthis/pglite is a modified distribution of PGlite by Electric DB
Limited:

https://github.com/electric-sql/pglite

This distribution uses its own package identity and builds the embedded
PostgreSQL/WASM engine from its own postgres-pglite fork. Exact upstream and
fork source revisions for each release are recorded in the signed
fork-lineage attestation associated with the package tarball:

https://github.com/simthis/pglite
https://github.com/simthis/postgres-pglite

